            "value": "Operations of “%1$@” (in the bin too) and its scheduled payments move to “%2$@”, and its name and other names become other names of “%2$@”. The card “%1$@” is deleted. No money moves: both cards are of one account, so balances and reconciliations stay as they are. “Undo” brings everything back."
          }
